                                "sense_id": "0dc339c1-0e84-3175-b9ca-a7bd358be577",
                                "text": "[…] is there some way to connect to my new comp so I can transfer some of the software progs […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed45a84e-55b8-4925-83b1-73112a657dea",
                                "sense_id": "0dc339c1-0e84-3175-b9ca-a7bd358be577",
